<title>AUSTRALIA: Kimberley Diamond Co changes name.</title>
<headline>Kimberley Diamond Co changes name.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberley Diamond Co NL said on Monday it had changed its name to Kimberley Resources Ltd and its status to a company limited by shares, effective Monday.</p>
<p>Kimberley also said the previously approved consolidatation of its capital on a five-old-for-one-new basis takes effect on June 24.</p>
<p>Trading in its new stock symbol begins on July 9, the company added.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
